  "releaseNotes": "Release candidate. Written for NuGet consumers; engine internals are not listed.\n      \n      - Renamed the HTTP request types used with the Indx server: `Indx.CloudApi.CloudQuery` is now\n        `Indx.Http.QueryProxy`, and `ICloudSearchEngine` is `IServerSearchEngine`. The old names\n        still compile with an obsolete warning until the next major version. Embedded use (`Query`,\n        `SearchEngine`) is unchanged.\n      - Optional indexing setups for the corpus at hand: `new ConfigurationParameters(IndexerSetup.Dense)`\n        for small corpora where short and partial queries should match generously, `IndexerSetup.SingleWord`\n        for codes and identifiers. The default is unchanged.\n      - Fixed: a configuration with text normalization turned off could be saved but not loaded.\n      - Fixed: the indexed-text ceiling and the \"too long search text\" status now behave as documented.\n      - The configuration API reference now carries worked examples for every constructor.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "IndxSearchLib",
